# Frontend Standards

Stack: Next.js, TypeScript, Tailwind, shadcn/ui.

- Strict TypeScript. No `any`. No disabled ESLint rules. No inline styles.
- No business logic in UI components. No API calls directly inside UI.
- Keep UI files under ~250 lines; split when larger.

## Feature folder

```text
Feature/
  Feature.tsx        # UI only
  Feature.logic.ts   # hooks, state, handlers
  Feature.styles.ts  # Tailwind class constants
  Feature.types.ts   # interfaces
  index.ts
```

## UI philosophy

Premium, calm, minimal, elegant. Whitespace, strong typography, smooth motion, subtle gradients. Not ChatGPT. Phone chat should feel like messaging a person (iMessage-inspired, not Apple-copied).

Lazy-load heavy widgets. Avoid unnecessary renders. Stream AI responses when possible.
